hi my name is philip and welcome to  let's talk religion  on this channel we talk about  religion and we do so from an academic  and scholarly perspective i have a  master's degree in  comparative religion also known as  religious studies and i try to bring  that expertise and experience when i do  these videos on this channel you will  find introductory videos about various  religious traditions  including the great  world religions but also smaller  traditions you also find deep dives into  obscure philosophers or theologies from  different religious traditions as well  as more documentary style videos where  we  explore and talk to religious  practitioners from different religions  as well there's no doubt that religion  is a massively important factor in the  world today both in terms of politics  but just society at large and yet the  religious literacy of many people is  very lacking when we have discussions on  this topic we often end up talking  across each other and never actually  meeting in a proper discussion because  there's a lack of understanding a lack  of education on these topics and that is  why it is so important that we increase  the religious literacy in the world that  we educate ourselves more about  religions how they work about other  people's religions in order that we can  meet and discuss and thus be able to  understand each other better and through  that hopefully we can achieve a world  with more understanding and tolerance  and that is what we try to do here at  let's talk religion we tackle various  topics of religion from a academic and  scholarly perspective based on  scientific research done by scholars and  thus try to present these topics from a  position that is as neutral and  objective as possible to provide you  with information that is trustworthy and  useful but also hopefully interesting  and engaging so again welcome to this  channel and i hope to see you in the  comments thank you  [Music]  foreign
 

